<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 59,200 MT were down 65 percent from the prior week and 16 percent from the 4-week average.  Mexico (36,800 MT) was the major buyer.</p>
<p>Exports of 107,100 MT improved 3 percent from the previous week, but were 29 percent below the 4-week average.  Mexico (67,500 MT) and Japan (37,100 MT) were the primary destinations.</p>
</text>
